  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/fact-sheets/17a-overtime" rel="noopener">US Department of Labor — Fact Sheet #17A: white-collar exemptions</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.dol.gov/agencies/whd/fact-sheets/23-flsa-overtime-pay" rel="noopener">US Department of Labor — Fact Sheet #23: Overtime Pay</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://www.bls.gov/ebs/" rel="noopener">US Bureau of Labor Statistics — Employee Benefits Survey</a></li>
  </ul>
</GuideLayout>
